9
00:00:29,080 --> 00:00:34,360
Sounds like the inch wins, right? Except you've got way more damn pounds than inches.

10
00:00:34,920 --> 00:00:36,640
Send this to whoever'd grab the hundreds.

11
00:00:37,200 --> 00:00:39,640
The CDC says the average American dude weighs one ninety-nine.

12
00:00:40,640 --> 00:00:42,220
And he's about five foot nine.

13
00:00:42,660 --> 00:00:46,780
So that's one ninety-nine pounds of twenties against sixty-nine inches of hundreds.

14
00:00:47,220 --> 00:00:50,140
His height in hundreds is about one point six million dollars.

15
00:00:50,920 --> 00:00:54,260
Now follow the math, because his weight is where it gets stupid.

16
00:00:54,640 --> 00:00:57,320
His weight in twenties is about one point eight million.

17
00:00:57,220 --> 00:01:01,300
So the damn scale pays two hundred grand more than the tape measure.

18
00:01:01,700 --> 00:01:04,840
So what's it gonna be, twenties, or the two hundred grand fuck-up?
